            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "camis6714"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This turned out terrible for me. After 45 min., I was barely able to puncture the potatoes. We didn’t serve the dish for dinner. I think my daughter threw the whole thing out the next day.",
            "datePublished": "2018-11-28T04:35:48.070Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Janet ODell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just had these for Thanksgiving. TO DIE FOR. All I added was a few chopped pecans. I did use much more than 1/2 cup orange juice but the outcome was perfect. The tang from the OJ and the sweet from the raisins entwined with the sweet potatoes is a heavenly experience. So much better than the syrupy, marshmallow, goup that is the norm. AND so much healthier.",
            "datePublished": "2012-11-22T15:11:53.820Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Katrina Arnell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I forgot to mention that I added a cinnamon blend to mine because I love the spices. Since there was no picture posted, I took a snapshot of my serving bowl before devouring the rest.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-22T13:33:32.197Z"
          },
          {
